        "summary": "Both clusters show slow magnetic relaxation; 1 is a single-molecule magnet under zero dc field with Orbach relaxation. χMT at 300 K is 46.19 cm3 K mol−1 (calc. 43.34 for 8 Co(II)+2 Dy(III)), rising to 57.96 cm3 K mol−1 at 2 K. Magnetization reaches 27.78 NμB at 70 kOe and 1.8 K without saturation. Frequency-dependent ac susceptibility is observed under zero field.",
